<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<h1>Welcome, <%= admin.name || admin.email %></h1>

<div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
  <a href="/admin/loans" class="card" style="text-decoration:none; color: inherit; border-left: 4px solid var(--red);">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">📥 Loan inbox</h2>
    <p class="muted">Review farmer-originated loan applications. Claim, approve, or reject with reason.</p>
  </a>
  <a href="/admin/reports/aggregate" class="card" style="text-decoration:none; color: inherit;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">📊 Cohort report</h2>
    <p class="muted">Test vs control NPA% with confidence intervals + weekly trend.</p>
  </a>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-2">
  <a href="/admin/imports/new" class="card" style="text-decoration:none; color: inherit;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">📤 Upload portfolio</h2>
    <p class="muted">Send a new 3-tab xlsx workbook for your bank. Loans / Schedules / Payments.</p>
  </a>
  <a href="/admin/imports" class="card" style="text-decoration:none; color: inherit;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">📋 Import history</h2>
    <p class="muted">View past uploads, success / fail counts, and error logs.</p>
  </a>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top: 24px;">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0;">How the pilot works</h2>
  <ol style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Every Monday, your bank sends a 3-tab xlsx workbook (Loans + Schedules + Payments) with the latest portfolio snapshot. Cohort tag (test/control) is in column N of the Loans tab.</li>
    <li>FarmerPay ingests the data into a transactional store keyed on your bank + branch + district.</li>
    <li>Daily at 02:13 IST, the NPA recalculation cron walks every loan, recomputes DPD from the schedule + payments, re-classifies SMA per RBI rules, and snapshots the result.</li>
    <li>You read the cohort report any time to compare NPA% in the engaged (test) cohort vs the un-engaged (control) cohort. Results include 95% Wilson CIs and a one-sided p-value on the difference.</li>
    <li>At the end of the 3-month pilot window, the report becomes the evidence for your credit committee.</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
